# The design everybody builds first: one of each, wired in a line, and the
# reactor left where the manual found it.
#
# It works, in the sense that electricity comes out. It is also burning a full
# fuel load to heat a room, because a single exchanger can only take a quarter
# of what the reactor makes and the rest goes up the stack.

machine "First Try"

reactor   R1  at 0,0
exchanger HX1 at 5,0
pump      W1  at 5,4
turbine   T1  at 9,0
generator G1  at 13,0

wire R1.heat  -> HX1.heat
wire W1.water -> HX1.water
wire HX1.steam -> T1.steam
wire T1.rotary -> G1.rotary
